  "2026-11-16T12:10:09.204Z",codex-sol,"Merged current main while preserving the existing PR caller pins. Failed Bun release gate job 132763811635 at test/sync.test.ts:1509 asserts only ado_partial_apply or apply_failed for a rejected concurrent recovery writer. Log line 1779 shows that assertion failed; this is not a registry or network timeout and no pin-driven runtime change explains it. Existing issue pm-ado-resolution-recovery-race records the same assertion under Bun coverage since November 8. Preserve writer safety assertions and use that issue for the separate race; no core recovery change in this workflow pin PR. No review threads were returned."
  "2026-11-16T12:28:55.955Z",codex-sol,"Prepared caller verification and root-cause evidence commit 02dbfc9. Exact caller test, typecheck, tracker validation and changelog:check pass on the merged branch. This repository has no lint script. Quick npm suite remains running; the original Bun recovery race remains owned by pm-ado-resolution-recovery-race and has not been hidden by broadening accepted refusal codes."
  "2026-11-16T12:58:56.621Z",codex-sol,"Original Bun failure is the unchanged concurrent recovery oracle assertion, not a registry timeout; existing pm-ado-resolution-recovery-race retains it. Caller contract, typecheck, changelog:check and tracker validation pass; no lint script exists. Full quick npm run is still active and has observed a separate packed launcher failure after 209881 ms, owned by pm-ado-packed-timeout. Neither full-suite success nor a fix to those runtime issues is claimed. Release the pin claim for orchestrator review."
  "2026-11-16T13:30:51.998Z",codex-sol,"Bounded final receipt: PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick npm test was stopped before terminal suite accounting to respect the continuation stop window. It is incomplete and excluded from passing evidence. The run observed an unchanged packed launcher failure after 209881 ms; pm-ado-packed-timeout owns it. The same-decision recovery test passed in this Node run, but the original Bun coverage refusal-oracle failure remains unverified and owned by pm-ado-resolution-recovery-race. Caller contract, typecheck, changelog and tracker validation pass. No lint script exists; no full-suite success is claimed. Keep ownership released and the item in progress."
